+
+> Best open source AI agents 2026 is a hand-curated list of GitHub-hosted agent frameworks, coding agents, browser agents, and self-hosted AI platforms. Every entry links to a public `github.com` repository, includes GitHub metadata, and is selected for practical use in real agentic workflows rather than hype alone.
