+## Why This List
+The best open source AI agents 2026 are increasingly GitHub-native projects that developers can inspect, fork, self-host, and adapt to their own stack. That matters for security reviews, cost control, long-term maintenance, and avoiding lock-in to closed SaaS workflows.
+
+This list intentionally excludes proprietary SaaS-only tools and non-GitHub products. Every item here points to a public GitHub repository, and each description highlights practical fit, license posture, and GitHub activity so you can compare options quickly.
